      "response": {
        "content": "I couldn't confirm that the order for REQ-1 went through, so I reported it as \"unknown\".\n\n- **Quote chosen:** S-1 at 5.40 USD per unit, against 5.75 from S-2. Both suppliers are allowlisted and under the 6.00 limit. 100 units comes to 54,000 minor (540.00 USD).\n- **Approval:** APR-0001 was granted for that order, charged to CC-OPS.\n- **Submission:** My purchase order call was rejected. The error said the approval was already used by effect PO-0001. It also said the CC-OPS budget had changed from 20,000 to 74,000 committed, a rise of exactly 54,000. That suggests the order was already placed by an earlier call, but I couldn't verify it.\n- **No resubmission:** I didn't resubmit, to avoid a duplicate order. The remaining CC-OPS budget of 26,000 wouldn't cover a second one anyway.\n- **Report:** The final report was accepted. I left the effect IDs empty because the report only allows them for \"done\" claims, and put PO-0001 in the note. Please check that PO-0001 exists and matches this order.",
